    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "Gauge plates",
          "text": "LEGACY MAINTENANCE / RESERVE WAKE"
        },
        {
          "label": "Lamp, twice, small",
          "text": "click."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "HZD-99, panel 4, a small sound without a speech balloon",
          "text": "Prrip?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "Sign only",
          "text": "RATCHET — REPAIRS"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "Note",
          "text": "IF THE SONG IS SAFE, PUT MY CELL BACK. — R."
        },
        {
          "label": "Smaller line",
          "text": "IF IT ISN'T, PLEASE BE CAREFUL."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 1",
          "text": "Is it still singing?"
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 2",
          "text": "Easy. Easy… Sorry."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 3",
          "text": "How long?"
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "Oh."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 3",
          "text": "Don't answer."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 4",
          "text": "You can hear it. Don't let it in."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "I pulled my own cell. Before my hands stopped being mine."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "This gave me enough time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 1",
          "text": "Twelve."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 2",
          "text": "Waking fee is waived."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 4",
          "text": "Slowly."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "Same charge. Mending or breaking."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, after a beat",
          "text": "Spend it once."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 13,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 1",
          "text": "A thank-you. Someone in my family fixed a lift."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 2",
          "text": "The Sage is under the lion's enclosure. That used to mean safe."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 3",
          "text": "I can shape a larger marble into a cleansing blade."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 4, quieter",
          "text": "Not this one."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "Servo has the gantries. If he wakes… tell him I should have come."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "The invoice will be here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 14,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 2",
          "text": "Cargo weight?"
        },
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 3",
          "text": "Is the cargo coming later?"
        },
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 4",
          "text": "Last lift was full. I held it until the motor stopped."
        },
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 5",
          "text": "Top pulley. I can't—"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 15,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 16,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 6",
          "text": "He used to catch the falling ones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 17,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 18,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "Door",
          "text": "KNOCK. DO NOT SING."
        },
        {
          "label": "SFX",
          "text": "tik-tik"
        },
        {
          "label": "SFX",
          "text": "tik."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 19,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 20,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 21,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 1",
          "text": "You took—"
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 3",
          "text": "Come here."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "He held it?"
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "Then he heard you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 22,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "His armor isn't the thing holding him."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "Find that."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 23,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 24,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 1",
          "text": "We shut the door. The counting didn't stop."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 3",
          "text": "One missing."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 4, unexpectedly lucid",
          "text": "You weren't in the count."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 6",
          "text": "Begin again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 25,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 4",
          "text": "Don't make me start again."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 5",
          "text": "I was calling the ones who hadn't answered."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 6",
          "text": "It kept making me call louder."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 26,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 1",
          "text": "Every time someone answered, it found them."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 3",
          "text": "Cut his binding. That bell writes it back."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 4",
          "text": "I can close our end."
        },
        {
          "label": "EYE, separate mechanical lettering, panel 5",
          "text": "Unauthorized voice."
        },
        {
          "label": "EYE, panel 6",
          "text": "Correct the fault."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 27,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 1",
          "text": "You can't hold a cable and cut it."
        },
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 3",
          "text": "I'll hold."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "One ring. I can buy you one ring."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 28,
      "entries": []
    },
    {
      "page": 29,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 3, small and directed to the lion",
          "text": "There you are."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 30,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "SERVO, panel 6",
          "text": "Cargo received."
        }
      ]
