        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 36,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "Keep it."
        },
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 6",
          "text": "I know where you'll bring it when it breaks."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 37,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "RATCHET, panel 5",
          "text": "Outside."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 38,
      "entries": [
        {
          "label": "MOTHER, panel 2, fragmented",
          "text": "…still… here…"
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 3",
          "text": "She made that gap."
        },
        {
          "label": "SAGE, panel 5",
          "text": "Mono kept the routes. One of them must reach her."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
